      "writtenOn": "2021-03-24T00:53:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see, I think you\u0027d have to call createPerApiVersionVariations with sdk_version instead of min_sdk_version, and replace min_sdk_version with sdk_version with cc_object.  I don\u0027t know whether that is better though.",
      "parentUuid": "ba529e35_ceb1df47",
      "revId": "fdaa5f71648b8e3c21a867db0a6751f5e1a2069b",
